WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:03,810
I guess Yoyo doesn’t know the value of these black cards at all.

2
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:08,120
last meal

3
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,520
what do you want to eat

4
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:10,920
Order it yourself, little idiot

5
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:18,650
Who is the little fool?

6
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:22,190
I'm afraid that I'll be betrayed by Youyou when I accompany Muya.

7
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:23,990
I still think that what I sell is not expensive enough.

8
00:00:23,990 --> 00:00:25,590
Jiaojiao is only three and a half years old

9
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:27,590
How can you make her face the wall and think about it?

10
00:00:27,590 --> 00:00:30,520
The old man was born in the military

11
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:33,120
She is very strict with her husband and several grandchildren.

12
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:34,720
Don't know what's going on

13
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:36,320
Come to accompany Jiaojiao here

14
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:38,120
It becomes a double standard.

15
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:39,720
Didn’t grandpa educate us from childhood?

16
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,520
Silent when sleeping

17
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:45,250
If you have anything to say, I'll tell you later.

18
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:47,850
Pai Jiaojiao has been particularly picky about food since she was a child.

19
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:50,050
Every time, a bunch of people have to chase after me.

20
00:00:50,050 --> 00:00:52,050
Just willing to take two bites

21
00:00:52,050 --> 00:00:56,040
Whenever the food is slightly not to her liking

22
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:57,640
She just cried and fussed

23
00:00:57,640 --> 00:00:59,840
He almost dropped the bowl

24
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,240
Jiaojiao has eaten

25
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,840
Come and grandma feed you

26
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:05,820
Old man, please feed Youyou.

27
00:01:05,820 --> 00:01:08,220
Yoyo, you can use chopsticks by yourself

28
00:01:08,220 --> 00:01:09,500
Meet grandma

29
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:10,900
This meat is delicious

30
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:13,660
Grandma, try it

31
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:14,860
He can also eat by himself
